<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose one point to 1,372.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose one point to 1,372.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,372 today from 1,371 on July 11, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1449    13.156	  1448    13.150</p>
<p>   1a   1363 10325.000	  1360 10300.000</p>
<p>   2    1730    24.719	  1730    24.719</p>
